// Set-alias variant of DetPrim for the proof-level (CLI prove) artifacts.
// Target pass: proof_frog/transforms/inlining.py DeduplicateDeterministicCalls.
// Uses a Set alias (Block) instead of BitString<n> signatures because the
// prove-context typechecker does not unify BitString<F.n> (instantiated
// method return type) with BitString<n> (game-local literal/param types).
// Eval/EvalInt are deterministic (collected by the pass); Gen is NOT
// (fresh i.i.d. coins per invocation, SEMANTICS.md 6.4).
Primitive DetPrimS(Set S) {
    Set Block = S;

    deterministic Block Eval(Block x);
    deterministic Block EvalInt(Int c);
    Block Gen();
}
